- UCP discovery: https://www.unmatchedsupply.com/.well-known/ucp
- MCP endpoint: https://www.unmatchedsupply.com/api/ucp/mcp
- Product data: https://www.unmatchedsupply.com/products/{handle}.json
- Collection data: https://www.unmatchedsupply.com/collections/{handle}/products.json
- Storefront API: Available via Shopify (see https://shopify.dev/docs/api/storefront)
- Sitemap: https://www.unmatchedsupply.com/sitemap.xml
- Robots.txt: https://www.unmatchedsupply.com/robots.txt
